<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Portofolio Saya</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        } 

        body {
            background-color: #0f172a;
            color: #f8fafc;
            line-height: 1.6;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        header {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #334155;
        }

        .profile-img {
            width: 120px;
            height: 120px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background-color: #38bdf8;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 0 auto 20px;
            font-size: 48px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #0f172a;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            color: #38bdf8;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .tagline {
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        section {
            margin: 30px 0;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #38bdf8;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #38bdf8;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            padding-bottom: 5px;
        }

        p {
            color: #cbd5e1;
        }

        .skills {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .skill-card {
            background-color: #1e293b;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            border: 1px solid #334155;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #38bdf8;
        }

        .projects {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }

        .project-card {
            background-color: #1e293b;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            border: 1px solid #334155;
            transition: transform 0.2s;
        }

        .project-card h3 {
            color: #f8fafc;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 15px;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            background-color: #38bdf8;
            color: #0f172a;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 50px;
            padding: 20px 0;
            color: #64748b;
            border-top: 1px solid #334155;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <div class="profile-img">P</div>
            <h1>ANANDA RIZKY SALAFI</h1>
            <p class="tagline">Developer / Designer / Programmer</p>
        </header>

        <section id="about">
            <h2>Tentang Saya</h2>
            <p>Halo! Saya adalah seorang pengembang web yang passionate dalam membangun aplikasi web modern, responsif, dan mudah digunakan. Saya biasa membuat dan menguji project langsung dari Termux.</p>
        </section>

        <section id="skills">
            <h2>Keahlian</h2>
            <div class="skills">
                <div class="skill-card">HTML5</div>
                <div class="skill-card">CSS3</div>
                <div class="skill-card">JavaScript</div>
                <div class="skill-card">Python</div>
                <div class="skill-card">Termux / Bash</div>
                <div class="skill-card">Git</div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="projects">
            <h2>Proyek Saya</h2>
            <div class="projects">
                <div class="project-card">
                    <h3>Aplikasi Web Portofolio</h3>
                    <p>Web portofolio pribadi yang dibuat dan dijalankan langsung dari Termux Android.</p>
                    <a href="#" class="btn">Lihat Detail</a>
                </div>
                <div class="project-card">
                    <h3>Project Lain</h3>
                    <p>Deskripsi singkat mengenai proyek kedua yang pernah Anda kerjakan.</p>
                    <a href="#" class="btn">Lihat Detail</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <footer>
            <p>&copy; 2026 ANANDA RIZKY SALAFI. Dibuat dengan Termux.</p>
        </footer>
    </div>

</body>
</html>

git add index.html
git commit -m "Update isi portofolio"
git push
